# approvals' queue routes (core/modules/approvals/README.md "Routes"): a member's session,
# approvals.read to read the queue, approvals.decide to approve or skip; only the owner of an item's
# sender, the account or an email's mailbox, reads and decides it (gamma-p6-050). Both POSTs are
# @Idempotent(): the Idempotency-Key is an example UUID; the same key answers the first press again.
# A write sends the cookie, so it sends Origin: {{appOrigin}} too. `approvalItemId` is a pending item
# of your own account: put it in http-client.private.env.json with your workspaceId.

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/approvals/items: your own queue, whatever your role: the pending items and the approved ones whose step waits of your own senders, by due time, each with its lead, draft, sender, stale and needsAttention flags and canDecide; senders, by label, each { accountId, mailboxId, label, timeZone, toApprove, decidedToday }, today in its own zone; counts.toApprove and counts.decidedToday, their sums
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/approvals/items
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/approvals/items/{id}/approve: approves the item with the text given, "" for an empty note, or the draft's own without one; 200 with the item; 403 not_sender_owner, 400 draft_text_refused with details.issues, 409 approval_item_not_pending or approval_draft_pending, 404 approval_item_not_found
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/approvals/items/{{approvalItemId}}/approve
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000003030

{ "text": "Ines, how does your team follow up on warm leads today? A short question about it." }

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/approvals/items/{id}/skip: skips the item, its draft left as it is; 200 with the item; 403 not_sender_owner, 409 approval_item_not_pending, 404 approval_item_not_found
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/approvals/items/{{approvalItemId}}/skip
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000003031
